<p>Just a short piece concerning the origin/history of the Hanged King, or the different versions of it. Of course, reading the piece doesn't necessarily require knowledge of 701, at least that's how I see it. Generally, I just feel like I have to get this idea out.</p>
<p>(Although I have to admit that, I used all those Chinese culture stuff as a vehicle mainly because writing in classic Chinese feels good :P)</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
